  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdff2a3fb5cc84e9",
      "translationZh": "在本地运行模型不是问题，那是容易的部分，但泄露发生在与它配套的第三方集成上。就像你把所有东西都设计得很完美，然后又加了一个云端 api，也许是用于评估的托管裁判、追踪 saas，或者嵌入服务端点。只要发出一次 http 调用，本地部署这回事就完了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c6c331c368bbe56",
      "translationZh": "我们已经保持在本地的部分有",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc7d94aff8be0122",
      "translationZh": "运行时：llama.cpp/ vllm /ollama",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46e1d378a30522fd",
      "translationZh": "模型：qwen 或 llama 系列，取决于机器配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7c6bafedd83fc44",
      "translationZh": "向量数据库：pgvector 或 qdrant",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "055380b834424c36",
      "translationZh": "有些会造成泄露，却仍未被注意到的部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4622f110e2d8bf03",
      "translationZh": "数据摄取：有些项目中的 pdf 和扫描件需要先经过解析和 ocr 步骤，再进行分块，而我们往往会在这里用上云端解析器，打破规则。不过，我们可以使用 liteparse 这类输入解析器，或 huggingface 上的其他开源选项，让这一步保持在本地。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f432057af54ce789",
      "translationZh": "评估：许多本地部署仍需要把提示词和输出发送到托管裁判或追踪仪表盘，以查看质量。这其实是同样的泄露，只是看起来不同。改用本地评分集或本地裁判模型，并尽可能采用自托管方式，就能处理追踪这一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00cc412338f15e51",
      "translationZh": "我很好奇，其他坚持 100% 本地运行的人使用怎样的端到端技术栈，很想多了解一些。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93c3a8dfeb362636",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/lucasbennett_1 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
